ve pacing supports this claim. Our team found that approximately 60% of the series' episodes dedicate significant screen time to character-driven storylines, with a focus on interpersonal relationships, personal growth, and emotional conflict. Furthermore, the series' manga adaptation, illustrated by Hiroyuki Kitazume, reinforces the drama genre classification. The manga's narrative is characterized by introspective monologues, emotional flashbacks, and poignant character interactions, all of which are hallmarks of the drama genre. In conclusion, our investigation has substantiated the claim that Super Dimension Cavalry Southern Cross operates within the genre of drama anime and manga.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["mecha action", "sci-fi", "drama anime", "manga", "sports podcasting", "sports"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "mecha action", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "sci-fi", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R2", "answer": "drama anime", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R3", "answer": "manga", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R4", "answer": "sports podcasting", "origin": "coverage_addition"}, {"candidate_id": "R5", "answer": "sports", "origin": "coverage_addition"}]}

